# Reserved for milestone dev-logs.
#
# As each milestone of the v1.0 refactor runs (via `/v1-milestone <N>`),
# a corresponding `milestone-<N>-dev-log.md` is written here. Always-write
# policy: every milestone writes a log, even if there were no deviations
# from the spec.
#
# Read order when planning a milestone:
#   1. 00-integration-contract.md
#   2. 01-implementation-plan.md
#   3. 02-open-questions.md
#   4. EVERY prior dev-log in this directory, in numerical order
#   5. The milestone spec for the milestone being implemented
#
# The five mandatory sections of each dev-log:
#   §1 Summary
#   §2 Deviations from the milestone spec ("No deviations from spec." is acceptable)
#   §3 Open questions raised or resolved
#   §4 Carry-forward notes (load-bearing for the next milestone)
#   §5 Verification (commands run + outcomes, with actual numbers)
